          <section class="cs-overview tc-overview">
            <div class="tc-intro">
              <dl class="cs-brief tc-brief">
                <div>
                  <dt>The problem</dt>
                  <dd>Teleco is a social robot that <mark>interacts with visitors</mark>. To make eye contact,
                    it first has to find them in the room.</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt>My part</dt>
                  <dd>I built the system that tells it <mark>where each person is standing</mark> and how tall
                    they are.</dd>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <dt>The result</dt>
